 34P  c  Compiled by B. Singh (McMaster), September 30, 2009                    
 34P  c  2009Ch43: E=34 MeV. Experiments done at BARC-TIFR facility.            
 34P 2c  Detector system was an array of seven Compton-suppressed Clover Ge     
 34P 3c  detectors placed at 30|', 60|', 90|, 120|' and 150|' relative to the   
 34P 4c  beam direction. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g, |g|g(|q)(DCO),                
 34P 5c  |g|g(|q,lin pol). Comparisons with truncated (1p-1h) shell-model       
 34P 6c  calculations in the {Isdpf} orbital space.                             
 34P  cG $ DCO values are from e-mail reply received from the                   
 34P 2cG first author of 2009Ch43 on Sept 14, 2009                              
 34P  cG M$ As proposed by 2009Ch43 based on |g|g(|q)(DCO)                      
 34P  cG M(A)$ Multipolarity consistent with qualitative |g|g(lin pol) results  
 34P  cG E(X)$ Weak |g ray                                                      
 34P  cL E$ From least-squares fit to the E|g's                                 
 34P  cL J$From |g|g(|q)(DCO) data of 2009Ch43                                  
